    "notes": "One vessel, both contributors active: part 2 (LiquidFuel/Oxidizer) gets its meter from the built-in `core` contribution, part 3 (Water/Food) gets its meter from the Kerbalism Uplink contribution (mod/GonogoKerbalismUplink/client/src/ShipMap/partMeters.ts), and part 3 also carries a fitted-process ship-map.part-meta row (a running water recycler). Demonstrates spec §13.4's self-contribution unify: one aggregated slot, two contributors, rendered by the SAME code path. Food.amount is deliberately small (0.4) to catch a fmtAmt-style rounding-to-zero bug in the tooltip's Meter valueLabel."
